    <string name="dev_link_body">Ibonisa imithombo ye-TV nawo wonke ama-app ayo, ishintsha umthombo kuma-TV angazinaki izinkinobho ze-HDMI, futhi isetha ukukhanya kwamanye. Isebenzisa uxhumano lokususa amaphutha (ADB) lwe-TV. Izinkinobho nokuthayipha kusebenza ngendlela efanayo ngaphandle kwalo.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_connect">Xhuma</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off">I-TV ilwenqabile uxhumano. Hlola ukuthi i-USB debugging ivuliwe. Kusukela ku-Android TV 14 amanye ama-TV amukela kuphela i-Wireless debugging, i-TennaRC engakakwazi ukuyisebenzisa.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off_short">I-debugging ivaliwe ku-TV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_forgotten">I-TV ikhohliwe le foni, njengoba i-Android TV yenza kufoni engayibonanga isonto. Zama futhi, bese uyivumela ku-TV.</string>
